  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After months spent on Gu refinement, Fang Yuan finishes Earth Treasury Flower King Gu in the same stretch as dusty Gu, Bright Pearl Gu, and Dark Toss Gu, right after he completes Moving Perspective Cup Gu from Gold and Silver Cup Gu, Another Perspective Gu, and Moving Form Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          425
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_bright_pearl_gu",
          "gu_dark_toss_gu",
          "gu_moving_perspective_cup_gu",
          "gu_gold_and_silver_cup_gu",
          "gu_another_perspective_gu",
          "gu_moving_form_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Earth Treasury Flower Gu is only rank two. After it advances again and again, it becomes the rank five Earth Treasury Flower King. See Earth Treasury Flower Gu for the base storage form planted on Qing Mao Mountain and in Three Kings blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          433
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-burial-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_earth_treasury_flower_gu",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "fac_three_kings"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Earth Treasury Flower King blooms open it is ten times larger than earth treasury flower, with huge dark golden petals soft as silk and dark golden floral liquid deep in its stamen. When it closes shut, its whole size is smaller than an infant’s fist.",
        "chapters": [
          433
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-burial-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "On the poisonous grassland, Fang Yuan stores a red Iron Cabinet Gu holding Fixed Immortal Travel in the flower’s stamen, then plants the Gu deep underground. Planting the rank five Gu costs him hours of primeval essence and primeval stones. Closed underground, it curls up and leaks no aura, finishing the hide of Fixed Immortal Travel after the iron cabinet cut the Immortal Gu aura.",
        "chapters": [
          433
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-burial-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_iron_cabinet_gu",
          "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At Qing Mao Mountain, Flower Wine Monk had hidden Gu worms in Earth Treasury Flower Gu; Fang Yuan uses that same storage line at king rank for the Immortal Gu he cannot keep in his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          433
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-burial-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
